# Runtime configuration is injected by Compose, never baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Editor recovery files can contain runtime credentials, even with extra dots.
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*.swx
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage*
**/htmlcov
**/node_modules
.commandcode
.superpowers
.agents
.codex
.hermes
.migration-runtime
# Never package local databases, uploads, generated static trees or evidence.
**/*.sqlite3
media
private_media
staticfiles
docs/migration/evidence
design_system_duralux
tests
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.hermes.md
novaversao.prd
mobile
.github
